      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "RAPID LULU (8) doesn't show much early dash but winds into her races, hitting the line hard to score two back then came home strongly into third (20.16) in a Mix 5 at this track last time. Solid record at the distance winning four races. Yet to win out of this box but has been in the placings two times from four starts. Expected to feature in the finish again. TOP SHELF TIM (1) has been beaten for early speed lately, last time finishing fifth (20.27) in a Mix 5 at this track. Solid record at the distance winning 12 races. The form from his last run is stacking up nicely. Great chance to atone. MAJESTIC ZEAL (2) had been in super honest form hitting the frame two times on end before finishing fourth (30.75) at Q Parklands last time. Likely to be about the money. KICKIN' TYRES (3) form at this course and distance reads well.",
